{"content":[{"c":["AHIO"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Abinadab’s son. With his brother Uzzah, Ahio drove the ox cart carrying the ark of the covenant to its new home at Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.6.3-4","r":"2Sam.6.3-4","rawR":"2Sam.6.3-4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.6.3-4","value":"2Sam.6.3-4"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 6:3-4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.13.7","r":"1Chr.13.7","rawR":"1Chr.13.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.13.7","value":"1Chr.13.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 13:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Elpaal’s son from Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.14","r":"1Chr.8.14","rawR":"1Chr.8.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.14","value":"1Chr.8.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:14"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Son of Jeiel and his wife Maacah. This Ahio was a brother or an uncle of Kish, Saul’s father (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.31","r":"1Chr.8.31","rawR":"1Chr.8.31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.31","value":"1Chr.8.31"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:31"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.36-37","r":"1Chr.9.36-37","rawR":"1Chr.9.36-37","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.36-37","value":"1Chr.9.36-37"}],"t":"ref","v":"9:36-37"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Ahio","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 6:3-4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.6.3-4","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.6.3-4","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.6.3-4"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 13:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.13.7","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.13.7","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.13.7"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.14","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.14","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.14"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:31","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_map